  "releaseNotes": "Version 4.0.3. Multi-assembly setup is now zero-config: the generated AddCqrsGenerated entry points are internal, so there is no \"composition root\" to designate and test projects / layered apps just work (no more cross-assembly CS0121). RunMode.Queued now fails fast with a clear error when no running host has started the queue consumer, instead of hanging.",
